OL,5,G0600 James Martin's American Adventure
OL,6,     FThe chef rides his motorbike
OL,7,     Fthrough the coastal city of Santa
OL,8,     FCruz, California. He shops at
OL,9,     Flocal farmers' markets before
OL,10,     Fcooking his recipes on a family
OL,11,     Frun artichoke farm. James also
OL,12,     Ftries his hand at surfing, but
OL,13,     Fgets upstaged by a dog
OL,14,G0925 ITV News
OL,15,G0930 James Martin's Saturday Morning
OL,16,     FJames is back in the kitchen on a
OL,17,     FSaturday morning where he's
OL,18,     Fcooking up a couple of delicious
OL,19,     Frecipes for singer Michael Ball
OL,20,     Fand enjoying dishes from chefs
OL,21,     FGalton Blackiston, Ruth Hansom and
OL,22,     FGlynn Purnell.
